{
  "id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44",
  "card_id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "44",
  "title": "二次方程的根的公式",
  "printed_title": "44. 二次方程的根的公式",
  "start_page": 258,
  "start_printed": 252,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 15,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们已经学过通过配出二项式的平方来解二次方程。\n每次这样求解，都需要进行较繁琐的变形。\n因此，我们先解一般形式的二次方程，推导出求根公式，以后就能直接用公式求解。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们学习了用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程. 但是这种方法需要作烦琐的变形. 因此，先求出一般形式的二次方程的解，引出根的公式，今后再按照这个公式解二次方程就比较方便.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "先考虑方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "为了求解方程",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，\n其中 $a\\neq0$， （1）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，　其中 $a\\neq0$，　（1）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把方程的每一项都除以 $a$，得到与它同解的方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们用 $a$ 除它所有的项，得到和它同解的方程",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$. （2）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$.　（2）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配方，配出二项式的平方：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "由三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配出二项式的平方：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这样，方程（2）可以写成：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程（2）具有下列形式：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$. （3）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$.　（3）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（3）与方程（1）同解，它们的根的个数取决于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的正负。\n因为 $a\\neq0$，所以无论 $a$ 取什么非零值，分母都为正。\n因此，只需看分子是正、是负，还是零，就能判断这个分式的符号。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程（3）的根的个数，也就是方程（1）的根的个数决定于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的符号. 因为 $a\\neq0$，所以当 $a$ 是任何数时，分式的分母是正的，于是，分式的符号由它的分子的符号确定.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用字母 $D$ 表示 $b^2-4ac$，方程（3）就可以写成",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们用字母 $D$ 表示式 $b^2-4ac$，并且把方程（3）写成",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1）设 $D<0$。\n这时，分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 为负，无论 $x$ 取什么值，表达式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 都为正。\n所以，方程（3）没有根，与它同解的方程（1）也没有根。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "1）设 $D<0$. 那么分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是负的，而当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是正的. 于是，在这种情况下，方程（3）没有根，也就是和它同解的方程（1）没有根.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2）设 $D=0$。\n这时，方程（3）变为：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "2）设 $D=0$. 那么方程（3）具有下列形式：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个方程只有一个根 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$，与它同解的方程（1）也只有这个根。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "所得到的方程，也就是和它同解的方程（1）有唯一的根$-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 设 $D>0$。\n把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：\n$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$.\n\n于是，方程（1）与下面的方程同解：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "3. 设 $D>0$. 我们把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$. 那么方程（1）就和下列方程同解：",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "分解因式，得到",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "就是",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，至少有一个因式为零：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "由此得：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$ 或 $x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$　或　$x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "分别解这两个一次方程，得到",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "就是",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 或 $x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　或　$x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以，方程（1）的两个根是：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程（1）有两个根：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 和 $\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把这两个根合写为：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "可采用下面的简便写法：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，\n其中 $D=b^2-4ac$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，其中　$D=b^2-4ac$，",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这就是二次方程的求根公式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们把它叫做二次方程的根的公式.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "二次方程是否有根、共有几个根，都取决于表达式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值。\n这个表达式叫作二次方程的判别式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们看到，二次方程的根是不是存在以及根的个数决定于表示式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值. 这个表示式叫做二次方程的判别式.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "归纳起来，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；\n当 $D=0$ 时，方程只有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；\n当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：\n$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 和 $\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#15",
        "p0261#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们已经知道，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；当 $D=0$ 时，它有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求根公式也适用于 $D=0$ 的情况。\n当 $D=0$ 时，公式变为：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们发现，二次方程的根的公式可以用于 $D=0$ 的情形.实际上，当 $D=0$ 时，公式具有下面的形式：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这两个符号选择给出同一个结果：\n$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "由此得　　$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，求根公式适用于任何有根的二次方程。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "因此，二次方程的根的公式适用于任何有根的二次方程.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下面用几个例子说明怎样利用求根公式解二次方程。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们来看利用上面推出的公式求解二次方程的例子.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1 解方程 $12x^2+7x+1=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 1　解方程　$12x^2+7x+1=0$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个方程的系数是 $a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "在这个方程里，$a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "先计算判别式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "求出判别式：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "判别式为正，所以方程有两个根。\n代入求根公式，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为判别式是正的，那么方程有两个根，这两个根可以利用二次方程的根的公式求出：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "分别取负号和正号，得到",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "由此得",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，\n$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，　$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以，方程的解集是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#15"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2 解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 2　解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "系数为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，因此",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，所以",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程只有一个根：\n$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程有唯一根：　$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3 解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 3　解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "系数为 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "这里 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "判别式为 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$.\n判别式为负，所以方程没有根。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "判别式 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$. 因为判别式是负的，所以方程没有根.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对于 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$，即使系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 中有一个为零，也可以用求根公式求解。\n系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个为零的二次方程，叫作不完全二次方程。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "在 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 这种形式的方程里，系数 $b$ 或 $c$当中即使有一个等于零，也可以根据二次方程的根的公式求解. 系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个等于零的方程叫做不完全的二次方程.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全二次方程。\n第一个方程的系数为 $a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$；\n第二个方程的系数为 $a=1$，$b=0$，$c=-1.21$；\n\n第三个方程的系数为 $a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全的二次方程. 在第一个方程里，$a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$，在第二个方程里，$a=1$，$b=0$，$c=1.21$，在第三个方程里，$a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "math-correction",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在用求根公式解不完全二次方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "下面我们利用所推出的公式解不完全的二次方程",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "先求判别式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "得到：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，\n$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "不过，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这两类不完全二次方程时，像前面那样把方程左边分解因式，往往更方便。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#15",
        "p0263#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们发现，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这种形式的不完全的二次方程时，正象我们在前面做过的一样，利用把方程左边分解因式的方法更方便.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，把方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 的左边分解因式，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "举例说，对于方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 得到：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，就是 0.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，等于 0.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "有时，把求根公式换一种写法，计算会更方便。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "解二次方程时，有时利用写成另一种形式的根的公式比较方便.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母都除以 2，再把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移入根号，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母除以 2 并且把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移到根号下面. 得到：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由 $D=b^2-4ac$，可得 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，也就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为 $D=b^2-4ac$，所以 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，求根公式可以写成：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "二次方程的求根公式可以写成下面的形式，就是：",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，\n其中 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，其中　$\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这种写法适用于判别式非负的任何二次方程（如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）。\n当 $b$ 是偶数，也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数时，常用这种写法。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "写成这种形式的公式，可以用来解判别式不是负值的任何二次方程（显然，如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）. 实际上，在 $b$ 是偶数（也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式.",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，求解方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "举例说，假设需要解方程",
      "changes": [
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$9x^2-14x+5=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "$9x^2-14x+5=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这里 $\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，$a=9$，$c=5$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#15"
      ],
      "source_text": "这里　　$\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，　$a=9$，　$c=5$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "wording"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#16"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{4}}{9}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 258,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0264#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{4}}{9}$",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{5}{9}$ 或 $x=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 258,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0264#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x=\\frac{5}{9}$　或　$x=1$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程的根是 $\\frac{5}{9}$ 和 1.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 258,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0264#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程的根是 $\\frac{5}{9}$ 和 1.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
  "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1",
  "edition": "modern-us-neutral",
  "status": "draft",
  "source": {
    "path": "lessons/alg7-c4-s3-n44/lesson.json",
    "sha256": "f58b51513a87fc4f1bd8a20d7cd8717eec6614c4342f5bc70879d80b87dc068d",
    "data": {
      "id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44",
      "card_id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44",
      "chapter": null,
      "section": null,
      "number": "44",
      "title": "二次方程的根的公式",
      "printed_title": "44. 二次方程的根的公式",
      "start_page": 258,
      "start_printed": 252,
      "figures": [],
      "exercise_count": 15,
      "prose": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们学习了用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程. 但是这种方法需要作烦琐的变形. 因此，先求出一般形式的二次方程的解，引出根的公式，今后再按照这个公式解二次方程就比较方便.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 252,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0258#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "为了求解方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 252,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0258#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，　其中 $a\\neq0$，　（1）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 252,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0258#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们用 $a$ 除它所有的项，得到和它同解的方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 252,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0258#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$.　（2）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 252,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0258#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配出二项式的平方：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程（2）具有下列形式：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$.　（3）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程（3）的根的个数，也就是方程（1）的根的个数决定于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的符号. 因为 $a\\neq0$，所以当 $a$ 是任何数时，分式的分母是正的，于是，分式的符号由它的分子的符号确定.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们用字母 $D$ 表示式 $b^2-4ac$，并且把方程（3）写成",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "1）设 $D<0$. 那么分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是负的，而当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是正的. 于是，在这种情况下，方程（3）没有根，也就是和它同解的方程（1）没有根.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "2）设 $D=0$. 那么方程（3）具有下列形式：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "所得到的方程，也就是和它同解的方程（1）有唯一的根$-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 253,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0259#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "3. 设 $D>0$. 我们把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$. 那么方程（1）就和下列方程同解：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "就是",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$　或　$x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "就是",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　或　$x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程（1）有两个根：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "可采用下面的简便写法：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，其中　$D=b^2-4ac$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们把它叫做二次方程的根的公式.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们看到，二次方程的根是不是存在以及根的个数决定于表示式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值. 这个表示式叫做二次方程的判别式.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们已经知道，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；当 $D=0$ 时，它有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 254,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0260#15",
            "p0261#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们发现，二次方程的根的公式可以用于 $D=0$ 的情形.实际上，当 $D=0$ 时，公式具有下面的形式：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得　　$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因此，二次方程的根的公式适用于任何有根的二次方程.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们来看利用上面推出的公式求解二次方程的例子.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例 1　解方程　$12x^2+7x+1=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在这个方程里，$a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "求出判别式：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为判别式是正的，那么方程有两个根，这两个根可以利用二次方程的根的公式求出：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，　$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 255,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0261#15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例 2　解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，所以",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程有唯一根：　$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例 3　解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "这里 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "判别式 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$. 因为判别式是负的，所以方程没有根.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 这种形式的方程里，系数 $b$ 或 $c$当中即使有一个等于零，也可以根据二次方程的根的公式求解. 系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个等于零的方程叫做不完全的二次方程.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全的二次方程. 在第一个方程里，$a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$，在第二个方程里，$a=1$，$b=0$，$c=1.21$，在第三个方程里，$a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "下面我们利用所推出的公式解不完全的二次方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们发现，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这种形式的不完全的二次方程时，正象我们在前面做过的一样，利用把方程左边分解因式的方法更方便.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 256,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0262#15",
            "p0263#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "举例说，对于方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，等于 0.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "解二次方程时，有时利用写成另一种形式的根的公式比较方便.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母除以 2 并且把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移到根号下面. 得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为 $D=b^2-4ac$，所以 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "二次方程的求根公式可以写成下面的形式，就是：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，其中　$\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "写成这种形式的公式，可以用来解判别式不是负值的任何二次方程（显然，如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）. 实际上，在 $b$ 是偶数（也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "举例说，假设需要解方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$9x^2-14x+5=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "这里　　$\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，　$a=9$，　$c=5$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 257,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0263#16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{4}}{9}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 258,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0264#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x=\\frac{5}{9}$　或　$x=1$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 258,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0264#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程的根是 $\\frac{5}{9}$ 和 1.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 258,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0264#3"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "section_breaks": [
    {
      "before": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.",
      "after": "1）设 $D<0$。\n这时，分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 为负，无论 $x$ 取什么值，表达式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 都为正。\n所以，方程（3）没有根，与它同解的方程（1）也没有根。"
    },
    {
      "before": "1）设 $D<0$。\n这时，分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 为负，无论 $x$ 取什么值，表达式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 都为正。\n所以，方程（3）没有根，与它同解的方程（1）也没有根。",
      "after": "2）设 $D=0$。\n这时，方程（3）变为："
    },
    {
      "before": "这个方程只有一个根 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$，与它同解的方程（1）也只有这个根。",
      "after": "3. 设 $D>0$。\n把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：\n$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$."
    },
    {
      "before": "这就是二次方程的求根公式。",
      "after": "二次方程是否有根、共有几个根，都取决于表达式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值。\n这个表达式叫作二次方程的判别式。"
    },
    {
      "before": "因此，求根公式适用于任何有根的二次方程。",
      "after": "下面用几个例子说明怎样利用求根公式解二次方程。"
    },
    {
      "before": "所以，方程的解集是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.",
      "after": "例 2 解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$."
    },
    {
      "before": "方程只有一个根：\n$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.",
      "after": "例 3 解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$."
    },
    {
      "before": "判别式为 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$.\n判别式为负，所以方程没有根。",
      "after": "对于 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$，即使系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 中有一个为零，也可以用求根公式求解。\n系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个为零的二次方程，叫作不完全二次方程。"
    },
    {
      "before": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，就是 0.",
      "after": "有时，把求根公式换一种写法，计算会更方便。"
    },
    {
      "before": "这种写法适用于判别式非负的任何二次方程（如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）。\n当 $b$ 是偶数，也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数时，常用这种写法。",
      "after": "例如，求解方程"
    }
  ],
